<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Structs on Quy Duong Minh — Software Engineer</title><link>https://quydmfl.github.io/tags/structs/</link><description>Recent content in Structs on Quy Duong Minh — Software Engineer</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>vi-VN</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://quydmfl.github.io/tags/structs/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>03. Value vs Pointer receiver &amp; struct embedding</title><link>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/fundamentals/03-value-pointer-receiver-embedding/</link><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/fundamentals/03-value-pointer-receiver-embedding/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Go truyền mọi thứ theo giá trị (pass by value) — kể cả struct. Bài này đi vào hệ quả trực tiếp: khi nào 1 struct bị copy mà lập trình viên không nhận ra, và vì sao chọn sai giữa value/pointer receiver là nguồn bug âm thầm phổ biến.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="value-receiver-method-nhận-bản-copy"&gt;Value receiver: method nhận bản copy&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" data-copy-code data-copied-label="Copied"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;CounterWrong&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;struct&lt;/span&gt;{ &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;n&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;c&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;CounterWrong&lt;/span&gt;) &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Inc&lt;/span&gt;() { &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;++&lt;/span&gt; } &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// value receiver: sửa bản copy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" data-copy-code data-copied-label="Copied"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;wrong&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;CounterWrong&lt;/span&gt;{}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;i&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;i&lt;/span&gt; &amp;lt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;++&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;wrong&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Inc&lt;/span&gt;()
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Println&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;wrong.n =&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;wrong&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" data-copy-code data-copied-label="Copied"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;wrong.n = 0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;0&lt;/code&gt;, không phải &lt;code&gt;5&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; — mỗi lần gọi &lt;code&gt;wrong.Inc()&lt;/code&gt;, Go tạo 1 bản copy của &lt;code&gt;CounterWrong&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;c.n++&lt;/code&gt; chỉ tăng trên bản copy đó, rồi bản copy bị vứt bỏ ngay khi hàm kết thúc. Struct gốc &lt;code&gt;wrong&lt;/code&gt; chưa từng bị đổi.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>